    "show_share": true,
    "description": "It is with deep regret that we inform you of the passing of Professor Brenda Leibowitz on 26th April 2018, a celebrated educationalist and an esteemed collaborator of Teaching and Learning efforts at AKU. As a life-long proponent of equal opportunity in education, Dr. Leibowitz had been offering her services to TL_net since 2016 when she facilitated a workshop on engaging with SOTL at GSMC Nairobi. More recently, she served as the key note speaker at the SOTL Conference at AKU Karachi in 2017 and conducted a pre-conference workshop with Dr. Kausar S. Khan. She championed AKU faculty's scholarship by inviting them to contribute to a special issue of the international peer reviewed journal SOTL in the South of which she was the editor-in-chief.",
